section__
  @title "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/00-prologue-core/frame-019.jpg"

  "Salt merchants on the Trident propose a convoy pact: they will prioritize Valehart shipments and deny credit to your declared enemies if you freeze river tariffs for one season and guarantee armed escorts. The docks stink of brine, wet hemp, and fear disguised as commerce.

It is not glorious, but wars are won by kitchens before cavalry. Secure the pact and your armies can march fed while rivals scavenge. Reject it and keep fiscal autonomy, but watch your supply chain become a bidding war between men who never bleed at the front.

Your marshal taps the map where three routes converge and says the same sentence twice: no food, no campaign. You sign nothing yet. You know signatures can be deadlier than steel when everyone is hungry."

  choice__
    @target "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
